  "findings": [
    "Whole-profile equality failed after first native startup: empty models-store.json and root mtime were new. Fresh no-Mandalore control produced the same native cache. All existing files/protected state were unchanged; this is not a zero-profile-effects claim.",
    "The final startup changed only the profile root mtime; all file bytes/modes/mtimes and managed state remained unchanged. An unreviewed draft receipt had an overly broad whole-profile flag; corrected before publication and retained draft privately.",
